<title>USA: America First PREP Fund 2 LP Q4 earnings up.</title>
<headline>America First PREP Fund 2 LP Q4 earnings up.</headline>
<text>
<p>OMAHA, Neb., March 31 (Reuter-</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> BUC			  $0.52		    $0.16</p>
<p> Net			    837			266</p>
<p> Revs			   909			340</p>
<p>	 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> BUC			  $0.99		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net			  1,598		    1,219</p>
<p> Revs			 1,911		    1,507</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: BUC is the abbreviation for Beneficial Unit Certificate.</p>
<p>The partnership said it recorded a gain of $598,867 in the fourth quarter of 1996 on the sale of its stake in the operating partnership that owns Ashwood Apartments.</p>
